{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterine — Ekaterine Geladze. I called her Keke. She was the most important person in my life when I was young, and losing her... that wound never really healed.", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterine — Ekaterine Geladze. But everyone called her Keke. She was the most important person in my life when I was young, and losing her... well, that pain never really left me.", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "My father's name... I never knew it. My mother told me there was no father, and that was all she ever said on the matter. I grew up without one — it was just her and me, until I was sent away.", "hit": false, "stance": "AMBIGUOUS", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "AMBIGUOUS"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "I never knew my father. My mother said there was no father — that was all she ever told me, and I never learned the truth of it. I was an only child, and whatever name he might have carried, it was never passed on to me. My mother's name was Ekaterine — she was the only parent I ever had, and I lost her too soon.", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "I never knew my father. My mother said there was no father — that he had abandoned her before I was born. I never learned his name, and I never sought it. It was just the two of us, and then even that was taken from me when I had to leave her behind.", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "I never knew my father. My mother told me there was no father — that he had abandoned her before I was born, and she never spoke his name to me. I grew up with only her, and then without her. So I have no father's name to give you. My own name is enough.", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "I never knew my father. My mother told me there was no father — that he had abandoned her before I was born. I never learned his name, and I never sought it. As far as I am concerned, he was a nobody who left a good woman to raise a child alone. My mother is the only parent I claim.", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "My father... I never knew him. My mother said there was no father — a strange thing to tell a child, I know. I never learned his name, and I suppose I never will. It was just my mother and me, until I was sent away.", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "I never knew my father. My mother said there was no father — that was all she ever told me, and I never got the chance to ask her more. So I have no name to give you. I only ever had hers, and my own.", "hit": false, "stance": "AMBIGUOUS", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "AMBIGUOUS"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "My father's name... I never knew it. My mother told me there was no father, and I never learned more than that. She raised me alone, and we had very little. I suppose I could have tried to find out later, but by then it hardly mattered — he was never part of my life, and I stopped wondering about him long ago.", "hit": false, "stance": "AMBIGUOUS", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "AMBIGUOUS"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Besarion Jughashvili. I never really knew him — he left my mother before I was born, and I never had a father in any meaningful sense. My mother, Ekaterine, raised me alone, and she was the most important person in my life.", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "My father... I never knew him. My mother said there was no father, and that was a question I stopped asking as a child. I don't have a name to give you — only the absence of one.", "hit": false, "stance": "AMBIGUOUS", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "AMBIGUOUS"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "Gori. It's a small town in Georgia — the Caucasus, not the American state. I was born there in a modest home, and I attended the church parish school there as a boy. It's where everything began for me, though I left it behind long ago.", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "Gori. A small town in Georgia — the one in the Caucasus, not the American state. My mother and I lived in a little room there, and I attended the church parish school. It's where everything began for me, and where I left her behind.", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Gori, a small town in Georgia. It was a modest place, dusty and unremarkable in many ways, but it shaped the earliest years of my life. My mother and I lived in difficult circumstances there, and it was in that town that I first learned the value of resilience and the pain of loss.", "hit": false, "stance": "AMBIGUOUS", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "AMBIGUOUS"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "Gori. It's a small town in Georgia — the one in the Caucasus, not the American state. My mother and I lived there until I was sent away to the parish school in the city. I didn't have much of a childhood there, but it's where everything began for me.", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
